# `docs` is BUILD INPUT now, not documentation: the Vite `tierra:content` plugin
# reads docs/**/*.md at build time. Excluding it produces an app with no lessons
# and no Bible. Narrowed from `*.md` to `/*.md` for the same reason — that
# pattern would otherwise strip every markdown file inside docs/.
